{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"H1已建立他怀有一份不知指向何处的期待；S02-B1中，两条贴近的歌声营造出亲密、温存、无需刻意交谈也能安心相处的体验。解释将这份具体的亲近感与此前无明确对象的期待联系起来：原本无处安放的盼望在亲近的体验中获得了可感知的方向，因此产生温柔的满足。这不仅是在宣布满足的结果，也交代了满足从何而来。这里的亲近可以理解为音乐唤起的心理体验，并未编造真实发生的人物相遇或关系前史。解释虽简短，但历史依据、当前听感与因果关系均成立。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S02-B2：心跳般持续摇荡的托举感、放弃控制的漂浮安适，以及水波不停、时间仍在流逝的暗流。\",\"S02-B4：甜蜜确认中同时出现鼻酸与惆怅，因为太珍惜眼前的好，尚未失去便已舍不得，希望时间慢些过去。\",\"S02-B5：情感短暂上涌、表达变得热切，随后又收回柔和；落稳后仍有漂浮，心事没有彻底说定。\"]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "50dc10cb-7e40-40b3-8517-0d92aadf9134", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045424828674Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:54:46.828040+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ba3685d7f52d72d01979e153cba7c860bae42857b8eb4c0f4aa9d486373e31b3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments